==Overview==
The '''Minigun Toilet''' is an [[Enemies|enemy]] that appears in [[Medium Mode]], [[Hard Mode]], [[Nightmare Mode]], Abysmal Mode in both events, and 
[[Christmas Mode]]. It's special ability is that it can use its miniguns to shoot at a [[Units|unit]], stunning it.
