== Abilities ==

* Minigun Shoot: Shoots a minigun at units, stunning it. This has a 25% chance (unconfirmed) to be used every time it passes a unit. 
== Strategy ==
*The Minigun Toilet stuns units frequently, so you can use Medic Cameraman or Camera Repair Drone or speaker repair drone to un stun units.
*Place unit further away from the road. Because it have short stun range.
==Trivia==
This is based off of the Gun Skibidi Toilet from the series.
